{"seq":1,"slug":"tricolor-invariant-and-barriers","title":"三色不变式与屏障类型：Dijkstra 插入写屏障、Yuasa 删除屏障与混合写屏障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/tricolor-gc-write-barrier/tricolor-invariant-and-barriers","wordCount":2843,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"三色不变式与屏障类型-dijkstra-插入写屏障-yuasa-删除屏障与混合写屏障\">三色不变式与屏障类型：Dijkstra 插入写屏障、Yuasa 删除屏障与混合写屏障</h1><p>一个电商订单服务在促销晚高峰把堆从 4GB 推到 30GB，GC 周期从 8ms 涨到 40ms，但 CPU 并没有被标记阶段吃满。问题往往不在「并发标记有多快」，而在「标记期间用户代码还在改指针，runtime 为不漏扫对象额外付出了多少屏障代价」。写屏障不是可选项，它就是并发的代价本身：只要标记与用户代码同时进行，就必须保证「已标黑的对象不会又指向白色对象」。本文讲清这条不变式的形式化、Dijkstra 与 Yuasa 两种经典屏障各守哪一侧、Go 1.8 混合写屏障为什么两侧都占，以及 <code>gcWriteBarrier</code> 每次触发做了什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三色标记把对象按「是否已被 GC 确认可达」分成三类，标记就是它们之间的单调迁移：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>白色</strong>：尚未被访问，标记结束时仍为白即判为垃圾。</li>\n<li><strong>灰色</strong>：已发现可达，但子指针未扫描，位于标记队列中。</li>\n<li><strong>黑色</strong>：已发现且子指针已全扫，标记结束时必存活。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>标记从根集合（栈、全局变量、寄存器）出发，循环取出灰对象、扫描其指针字段、把指向的白对象染灰，最后把自己染黑。若能原子地暂停世界，扫描结束时的黑色集合恰好是可达集。并发标记打破了这个原子性，于是出现两条会漏标的路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>插入窗口</strong>：黑对象已扫描完毕后，mutator 给它写入了指向某白对象的指针。该白对象现在还从黑对象可达，但黑对象不会再被扫描，白对象也无其他路径再次被发现，于是标记结束时仍是白色——被错误回收。</li>\n<li><strong>删除窗口</strong>：灰/黑对象原本持有指向白对象的指针，mutator 把它覆盖掉。白对象此刻仍可达（可能另有未扫描的路径指向它），但唯一能发现它的那条边已被删除，回收器再也找不到它。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三色不变式（tricolor invariant）刻画「不出现漏标」的条件：<strong>不存在从黑色对象直接指向白色对象的引用</strong>。只要维持这条不变式，标记结束后所有白对象必然不可达。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>守的窗口</th>\n<th>屏障动作</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n<th>授予的能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Dijkstra 插入写屏障</td>\n<td>新引用写入</td>\n<td>写前把新值染灰入队</td>\n<td>每次指针写触发屏障</td>\n<td>标记可不重扫黑对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yuasa 删除写屏障</td>\n<td>旧引用被覆盖</td>\n<td>覆盖前把旧值染灰入队</td>\n<td>多一次旧值读，浮动垃圾</td>\n<td><strong>栈无需重扫</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合写屏障（1.8+）</td>\n<td>两侧同时</td>\n<td>旧值与新值一并染灰</td>\n<td>写屏障成本略高</td>\n<td>标记期栈不重扫，STW 亚毫秒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三色不变式的形式化与漏标证明\">三色不变式的形式化与漏标证明</h2><p>把颜色函数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>white</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>gray</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>black</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c: O \\to \\{\\text{white}, \\text{gray}, \\text{black}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">white</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gray</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">black</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，出边关系记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。不变式写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>black</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext>white</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall o_b \\in O,\\ \\forall o_w \\in p(o_b): \\quad c(o_b) = \\text{black} \\implies c(o_w) \\neq \\text{white}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">black</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">white</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>它为何充分？</strong> 反设标记结束时某个可达对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 仍为白。取从根到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 的路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0 \\to \\dots \\to x_k = o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>。根 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 早已染灰，故沿路径必存在第一处颜色从「非白」跳到「白」，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext>white</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(x_i) \\neq \\text{white}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">white</span></span></span></span></span></span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>white</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(x_{i+1}) = \\text{white}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">white</span></span></span></span></span></span>。标记结束时无灰色对象（灰队列已空），所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>black</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(x_i) = \\text{black}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">black</span></span></span></span></span></span>，于是黑对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接指向白对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{i+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，违反不变式——矛盾。</p>\n<p><strong>插入屏障的推理</strong>：违反不变式的唯一方式是黑对象在扫描之后获得指向白对象的新边；写指针时染灰新目标，该边立即变成黑→灰，不变式恢复。</p>\n<p><strong>删除屏障的推理</strong>：若灰对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 持有指向白对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的边且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 仅经此边可达，覆盖这条边会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 变成「本应可达却无人能发现」。覆盖<strong>之前</strong>把旧值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 染灰入队，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 就会像任何灰对象一样被扫描；删除屏障利用更弱的假设：<strong>任何指针槽被覆写时，其旧值必须先被确认可达</strong>。</p>\n<p>删除屏障要先读旧值再染灰，多一次内存读，但换来一个巨大好处——<strong>栈不必在标记结束时重扫</strong>：只用插入屏障时，若某栈在标记中已作为黑根扫过，之后栈上新写入的指针就无人负责，所以必须在标记终止前 STW 重扫所有栈；删除屏障则保证「栈上消失的引用已把旧值标灰」，栈的任何变化都不会漏标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dijkstra-插入写屏障与-yuasa-删除屏障\">Dijkstra 插入写屏障与 Yuasa 删除屏障</h2><p>Dijkstra 等人在 1978 年的论文 <em>On-the-fly Garbage Collection: An Exercise in Cooperation</em>（<em>Communications of the ACM</em> 21(11)）给出第一个可用的并发标记算法，核心是<strong>增量更新屏障</strong>（incremental update barrier）：写指针时若新目标是白则染灰。伪代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"writeBarrier(slot, newValue):&#10;    if newValue is white:&#10;        shade(newValue)          # 染灰并入标记队列&#10;    store(slot, newValue)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>writeBarrier(slot, newValue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if newValue is white:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shade(newValue)          # 染灰并入标记队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    store(slot, newValue)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Go 1.5–1.7 采用这个变体。每次指针写都要走屏障（含写 channel 队列、slice 元素、struct 字段），且标记终止前必须 STW 重扫所有 goroutine 栈——栈若也拦截写入就要在每次 push/pop 触发屏障，代价过高，于是选择「栈写入不拦截，标记终止前统一重扫」，这在 1.7 及更早版本造成每次 GC 一次可见的 STW 峰值。</p>\n<p>Yuasa 在 1990 年提出<strong>基于快照的删除屏障</strong>（snapshot-at-beginning，SATB），论文为 <em>Real-time garbage collection on general-purpose machines</em>（<em>Journal of Systems and Software</em> 11(3)）。屏障在覆盖指针前把旧值染灰：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"writeBarrier(slot, newValue):&#10;    oldValue = *slot&#10;    if oldValue is white:&#10;        shade(oldValue)          # 旧值染灰入队&#10;    *slot = newValue\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>writeBarrier(slot, newValue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    oldValue = *slot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if oldValue is white:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shade(oldValue)          # 旧值染灰入队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    *slot = newValue</span></span></code></pre></div><p>直觉是「快照」：SATB 假设标记开始时存在一个逻辑快照，任何在该时刻可达的对象都必须活过本轮。mutator 删除一条边，等于让某对象在「现在」不可达，但它在快照时刻可达，所以要救回来——染灰旧值正是这个动作。收益是<strong>标记期无需 STW 重扫栈</strong>，代价是每次写多一次旧值读，且可能「复活」本可回收的浮动垃圾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"go-1-8-混合写屏障-两侧同时守\">Go 1.8 混合写屏障：两侧同时守</h2><p>Go 1.7 的 STW 栈重扫成了延迟瓶颈：即便标记高度并发，标记终止那次 STW 仍要遍历所有 goroutine 栈，goroutine 越多、栈越深，峰值越长。Go 1.8 引入<strong>混合写屏障</strong>（hybrid write barrier），设计文档见 golang/go issue <strong>17503</strong>「runtime: simplify write barriers」。屏障同时做插入与删除：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"writeBarrier(slot, newValue):&#10;    oldValue = *slot&#10;    if slot points into the heap and oldValue is white:&#10;        shade(oldValue)              # 删除语义: 旧值染灰&#10;    if newValue is white:&#10;        shade(newValue)              # 插入语义: 新值染灰&#10;    *slot = newValue\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>writeBarrier(slot, newValue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    oldValue = *slot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if slot points into the heap and oldValue is white:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shade(oldValue)              # 删除语义: 旧值染灰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if newValue is white:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shade(newValue)              # 插入语义: 新值染灰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    *slot = newValue</span></span></code></pre></div><p>叠加后黑→白边被插入屏障挡住，消失的边被删除屏障兜住，三色不变式在两个窗口里都成立。混合屏障真正买到的能力是：<strong>标记阶段完全不需要重扫栈</strong>。栈上的每次覆写也会触发删除屏障，栈不可能出现「无人负责的白对象」，runtime 可以在标记开始/goroutine 被抢占时增量地扫一次栈，之后不再回头。这直接让 Go 1.8 把 GC 的 STW 压到通常 <strong>100 微秒以内</strong>。两个细节：<strong>其一</strong>，混合屏障下栈对象在标记开始时被统一染黑（随后会被完整扫描，标黑是安全的保守处理）；<strong>其二</strong>，屏障只对「写入堆且指向堆」的槽位生效，写入栈或非指针字不触发删除语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"屏障在-runtime-里的落点与代价\">屏障在 runtime 里的落点与代价</h2><p>写屏障不是独立函数，而是被编译器插入到<strong>每一次可能写入堆指针的赋值</strong>上。编译期，<code>cmd/compile</code> 的 SSA <code>writebarrier</code> pass 判断赋值是否可能写堆，是则改写为对 <code>runtime.gcWriteBarrier</code> 系列例程的调用。这些例程（<code>runtime/mbarrier.go</code>）共享 per-P 的<strong>屏障缓冲</strong>（<code>wbBuf</code>），把待染灰的指针成批记录，达阈值后一次性泵入标记队列，避免每次写都抢标记队列锁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Go 代码: obj.field = ptr] --&gt; B{编译器 writebarrier pass}&#10;  B --&gt;|非指针或栈写入| C[直接 MOV]&#10;  B --&gt;|可能写堆指针| D[runtime.gcWriteBarrier]&#10;  D --&gt; E[读 slot 旧值 oldValue]&#10;  E --&gt; F{oldValue 为白 且 slot 在堆?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[shade oldValue 入 wbBuf]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[跳过]&#10;  G --&gt; I{newValue 为白?}&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[shade newValue 入 wbBuf]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[跳过]&#10;  J --&gt; L[wbBuf 满则唤醒灰色队列]&#10;  K --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; N[落盘 slot = newValue]\">graph TD\n  A[Go 代码: obj.field = ptr] --&gt; B{编译器 writebarrier pass}\n  B --&gt;|非指针或栈写入| C[直接 MOV]\n  B --&gt;|可能写堆指针| D[runtime.gcWriteBarrier]\n  D --&gt; E[读 slot 旧值 oldValue]\n  E --&gt; F{oldValue 为白 且 slot 在堆?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[shade oldValue 入 wbBuf]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[跳过]\n  G --&gt; I{newValue 为白?}\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt;|是| J[shade newValue 入 wbBuf]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[跳过]\n  J --&gt; L[wbBuf 满则唤醒灰色队列]\n  K --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; N[落盘 slot = newValue]</pre><p>屏障的<strong>直接成本</strong>是每次指针写多几条指令和一次可能的内存读；<strong>间接成本</strong>是它破坏内联与寄存器分配——编译器必须在调用前后保存/恢复活寄存器。设一次 GC 周期内 mutator 执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次堆指针写、每次屏障额外开销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期，总开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Nc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。指针密集负载（链表、树、map 重哈希、channel 高并发收发）里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 很大，GC 的 CPU 占比会显著上升。关键在于：<strong>屏障成本不体现在 GC 的自有 CPU 里，而是被摊进 mutator</strong>，只看 <code>/gc/scan/heap</code>、<code>/gc/pauses</code> 会漏掉它。减少堆指针写因而是真实的优化手段：把频繁修改的字段合并成一次写；用值数组或索引数组替代指针数组；把热数据留在栈上以减少逃逸——这与内存分配器的尺寸类选择（见 <code>../2_memory-allocator-tcmcp/1_size-class-span-mcache-model.md</code>）是同一场「减少堆交互」的战役。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本演进与工程选型\">版本演进与工程选型</h2><p>从 Go 1.5 到 1.24 的这条线，本质是在「屏障成本」与「STW 重扫成本」之间做权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Go 版本</th>\n<th>标记方式</th>\n<th>屏障</th>\n<th>STW 栈重扫</th>\n<th>关键事实</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤1.4</td>\n<td>STW 标记</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无（世界全停）</td>\n<td>大堆下 STW 到秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.5–1.7</td>\n<td>并发标记</td>\n<td>Dijkstra 插入屏障</td>\n<td>有（标记终止）</td>\n<td>首次并发化；每周期一次可见峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.8</td>\n<td>并发标记</td>\n<td><strong>混合写屏障</strong></td>\n<td><strong>无</strong></td>\n<td>STW 通常 &lt;100us，见 issue 17503</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.19–1.24</td>\n<td>并发标记</td>\n<td>混合屏障 + 软内存上限</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 落地（1.19），屏障语义稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程含义有三条。<strong>第一，永远不要绕过屏障改堆指针</strong>——用 <code>//go:linkname</code> 或 unsafe 把指针塞进 <code>uintptr</code> 型字段再写回会让屏障失效，把「回收仍在引用的对象」变成可能，这类 bug 表现为随机崩溃而非稳定报错。<strong>第二，<code>runtime.KeepAlive(x)</code> 与 Go 1.21 引入的 <code>runtime.Pinner</code> 解决的是「可达性」而非「屏障」问题</strong>：编译器与 GC 都可能认为某对象已死，<code>KeepAlive</code> 把存活期延长到调用点。<strong>第三，栈上不需要屏障</strong>，减少逃逸是降低屏障总成本的结构性手段——GC 倚赖抢占让 goroutine 在安全点停下扫栈，见 <code>../1_gmp-scheduler-internals/2_preemption-syscall-and-handoff.md</code>。实战判据：当 P99 随堆大小线性上升、且 <code>GODEBUG=gctrace=1</code> 显示 mark termination 的 STW 明显拉长时，先怀疑「是否存在大量堆指针写热点」，而不是先调 <code>GOGC</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三色不变式是并发标记的正确性基石：<strong>不存在黑对象直接指向白对象的边</strong>，证明依赖「标记结束时无灰色对象」这一前提。</li>\n<li>插入屏障（Dijkstra 1978）在写指针时染灰新值，守「新增的黑→白边」，但要求标记终止前 STW 重扫所有栈。</li>\n<li>删除屏障（Yuasa 1990，SATB）在覆盖指针前染灰旧值，守「消失的边」，换来<strong>标记期无需重扫栈</strong>，代价是浮动垃圾与一次额外旧值读。</li>\n<li>Go 1.8 混合写屏障（golang/go issue 17503）叠加两者，栈在标记开始统一染黑且不再重扫，把 STW 压到通常 100 微秒以内。</li>\n<li>屏障落在 <code>cmd/compile</code> 的 <code>writebarrier</code> pass 与 <code>runtime.gcWriteBarrier</code>/<code>wbBuf</code> 上，成本被摊进 mutator，指针密集负载要多盯其间接开销。</li>\n<li>工程上：绝不绕过屏障写堆指针；用 <code>KeepAlive</code>/<code>Pinner</code> 管可达性；优先把热数据留在栈上以减少屏障触发。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三色不变式与屏障类型：Dijkstra 插入写屏障、Yuasa 删除屏障与混合写屏障","id":"三色不变式与屏障类型-dijkstra-插入写屏障-yuasa-删除屏障与混合写屏障"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三色不变式的形式化与漏标证明","id":"三色不变式的形式化与漏标证明"},{"level":2,"text":"Dijkstra 插入写屏障与 Yuasa 删除屏障","id":"dijkstra-插入写屏障与-yuasa-删除屏障"},{"level":2,"text":"Go 1.8 混合写屏障：两侧同时守","id":"go-1-8-混合写屏障-两侧同时守"},{"level":2,"text":"屏障在 runtime 里的落点与代价","id":"屏障在-runtime-里的落点与代价"},{"level":2,"text":"版本演进与工程选型","id":"版本演进与工程选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存膨胀与碎片治理：堆目标、scavenger 归还、GODEBUG 分配器开关与 RSS 偏差排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/memory-allocator-tcmcp/fragmentation-and-memory-bloat"},"next":{"title":"GC 四阶段与 Pacer：并发标记、mark assist、清扫与 GOGC/GOMEMLIMIT 反馈调节","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/tricolor-gc-write-barrier/gc-phases-pacer-and-assist"}}